},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[43]}],"title":"Get_z-image-model","properties":{},"widgets_values":["z-image-model"],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":48,"type":"Note","pos":[265.93,106.67],"size":[210,88],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"text":""},"widgets_values":["emptyLatent / Z-Image-Turbo"],"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":51,"type":"KSampler","pos":[694.6926401473347,242.9239364567564],"size":[377.67,654.29],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":39},{"localized_name":"positive","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":40},{"localized_name":"negative","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":41},{"localized_name":"latent_image","name":"latent_image","type":"LATENT","link":42},{"localized_name":"seed","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"steps","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"cfg","name":"cfg","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"cfg"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"sampler_name","name":"sampler_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"sampler_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"scheduler","name":"scheduler","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"scheduler"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"denoise","name":"denoise","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"denoise"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","slot_index":0,"links":[36]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"KSampler","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.3.29"},"widgets_values":[0,"fixed",4,1,"res_multistep","simple",1]},{"id":58,"type":"ModelSamplingAuraFlow","pos":[468.31264014733466,261.8139364567564],"size":[210,58.043641795188364],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":43},{"localized_name":"shift","name":"shift","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"shift"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","slot_index":0,"links":[39]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ModelSamplingAuraFlow","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.3.64"},"widgets_values":[3]},{"id":55,"type":"Note","pos":[265.93,572.22],"size":[347.0786268338832,470.12320830642824],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["Z-Image-Turbo는 **“공식 데모(허깅페이스 Space)에서 미리 잡아둔 해상도 버킷”**을 쓰는 게 제일 안정적. (학습 마지막 단계 도메인에 들어가 있어서 품질/안정성이 좋다고 팀이 직접 언급) ([Hugging Face][1])\n\n아래는 **공식 Space(app.py)에 들어있는 추천 해상도 리스트**예요. ([Hugging Face][2])\n\n---\n\n## 1) 1024 버킷 (가장 무난/빠름)\n\n* **1:1** → 1024×1024\n* **9:7 / 7:9** → 1152×896 / 896×1152\n* **4:3 / 3:4** → 1152×864 / 864×1152\n* **3:2 / 2:3** → 1248×832 / 832×1248\n* **16:9 / 9:16** → 1280×720 / 720×1280\n* **21:9 / 9:21** → 1344×576 / 576×1344 ([Hugging Face][2])\n\n추천 용도: 썸네일, SNS 이미지, 빠른 반복 생성(시안 뽑기)\n\n---\n\n## 2) 1280 버킷 (디테일 더, 속도/VRAM은 조금 더)\n\n* **1:1** → 1280×1280\n* **9:7 / 7:9** → 1440×1120 / 1120×1440\n* **4:3 / 3:4** → 1472×1104 / 1104×1472\n* **3:2 / 2:3** → 1536×1024 / 1024×1536\n* **16:9 / 9:16** → 1536×864 / 864×1536\n* **21:9 / 9:21** → 1680×720 / 720×1680 ([Hugging Face][2])\n\n추천 용도: 광고 컷/제품샷/인물 디테일 조금 더 필요할 때\n\n---\n\n## 3) 1536 버킷 (가장 큰 “공식 프리셋”)\n\n* **1:1** → 1536×1536\n* **9:7 / 7:9** → 1728×1344 / 1344×1728\n* **4:3 / 3:4** → 1728×1296 / 1296×1728\n* **3:2 / 2:3** → 1872×1248 / 1248×1872\n* **16:9 / 9:16** → 2048×1152 / 1152×2048\n* **21:9 / 9:21** → 2016×864 / 864×2016 ([Hugging Face][2])\n\n추천 용도: 큰 화면(배너/히어로), 크롭 여유, 업스케일 없이도 선명도 더 필요할 때\n\n---\n\n## “아무 사이즈나” 쓰고 싶으면 (규칙)\n\n팀 답변 기준으로는:\n\n* **width/height가 16으로 나누어 떨어지고**\n* 1024 그리드 기준으로 **대략 768~1280 범위 안쪽(±256 정도)**이면 가능하긴 한데,\n* **그래도 위 프리셋을 쓰는 걸 추천**한다고 했어요. ([Hugging Face][1])\n\n\n[1]: https://huggingface.co/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo/discussions/28 \"Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo · latent size\"\n[2]: https://huggingface.co/spaces/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo/blob/main/app.py \"app.py · Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo at main\"\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":54,"type":"EmptySD3LatentImage","pos":[265.93,425.24],"size":[270,106],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"width","name":"width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"width"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"height","name":"height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"height"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"batch_size","name":"batch_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"batch_size"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[42]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"EmptySD3LatentImage","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.3.64"},"widgets_values":[1024,1024,1]}],"links":[[36,51,0,49,0,"LATENT"],[37,56,0,49,1,"VAE"],[38,49,0,50,0,"IMAGE"],[39,58,0,51,0,"MODEL"],[40,52,0,51,1,"CONDITIONING"],[41,53,0,51,2,"CONDITIONING"],[42,54,0,51,3,"LATENT"],[43,57,0,58,0,"MODEL"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.9149589086259928,"offset":[500.12778910875875,25.40930978911044]},"workspace_info":{"id":"z-image-turbo-emptylatent"},"ue_links":[],"workflowRendererVersion":"LG"},"version":0.4}